        "TileImage": "$($repository 283cd6a4-c889-4ca6-ac9d-000cd5ddf3b2).Image",
        "Description": "47, we have gathered intel that &quot;The Family&quot; syndicate is currently active in Sapienza, Italy. The syndicate has sent in 4 members to infiltrate our ICA facility nearby, the ICA hopes you will stop them. \rAs a reminder, do not kill any non-targets and do not be seen by the cameras.\rWe have dispatched you during the day so it is easier to eliminate the targets, they are planning to strike tonight.\r3 of 4 targets are all under the guise of gardeners for the chruch. \r1 of 4 targets is a pop star.",
